  <NAME>Expression profile of MM.1S tumors folloiwing treatment with bortezomib</NAME>
  <TITLE>Expression profile of MM.1S tumors folloiwing treatment with bortezomib</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>MM.1S orthotopic tumors were analyzed fro their gene expression upon tumor outgrowth. In contorl/bortezomib/elesclmol and combo treatments. Overall design: examination of three tumors for each condition.</DESCRIPTION>
